me even said I wasn't cut out for the sea.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_157","b","013","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_157","The more they said that, the more I refused to quit.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_161","b","002",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","004","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_157","You chase blank spots on a map, I chase the waves. At the end of the day, we're both pursuing what we believe in.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","010","happy",null,null,null,null,"xuanyun","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_157","I guess to everyone else, we're both stubborn weirdos.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","b","010","love",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_161","I'll take that as a compliment.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_157","b","009",null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Hmph, don't get cocky. Survive this voyage first, then we'll—",0,""],["w",0.5],["clear",1,0.5,1],["stg",0,-200.0,-100.0,1.5,"OutCubic",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["se","se_053"],["tsk","Zhong"],["say","avg1_155","Karin! Leafia! Come out here and look at this!",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","deck_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_155","b","009",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_370"],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_155","There's something strange in the water.",0,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_157","b","006",0.35,-0.45,1.5,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_157","b","006","symbol",null,-0.35,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Huh... What is that thing? It's blue